<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg starts golf stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ladenburg starts golf stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg, Thalmann analyst Joseph Teklits said he initiated coverage of Callaway Golf Co with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $40. The stock rose 1-1/2 to 33-5/8.</p>
<p>-- He started Family Golf Centers Inc as a buy, with a 12-month target of $42. The stock was up 1/2 to 28.</p>
<p>-- The analyst put a long-term buy on LESCO Inc and a 12-month target in the mid-$20s. The stock was flat at 16-5/8.</p>
<p>-- He reiterated buy ratings on Cutter &amp; Buck Inc and Ashworth Inc.</p>
</text>
